  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Enhancing the Conservation and Sustainable Use of Biodiversity to Meet India&#x2019;s Commitment to the Kunming-Montreal Global Biodiversity Framework Targets by 2030</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This is a GEF Project Preparation Grant phase to develop a full project document for the Project &#x2018;Enhancing the conservation and sustainable use of biodiversity to meet India&#x2019;s commitment to the Kunming-Montreal Global Biodiversity Framework targets by 2030&#x2019;, with supporting documentation for submission to the GEF for CEO endorsement. The Project Identification Form (PIF), submitted by UNDP as the GEF Agency, on behalf of the Government of India was technically cleared by GEF Secretariat and approved in the June 2024 Work Programme of the GEF Council.</narrative>
  </description>
